        "PublicId": "111167540491",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ecc907c9-5e40-4bc2-b492-9bef5c49cd64).Image",
        "Description": "`Trackside Emergency`\r\rAfter dealing with the propaganda wing, have uncovered evidence of a branch of The Orpheus League called &quot;The Moirai Division&quot;. \r\rThey have embedded a covert surgical team inside the medical facilities of a major racing event. Injured staff and disappearing civilians are being transported to an illegal transplant operation under the guise of medical emergencies to an unknown location. \r\rInfiltrate the event, find the operators, and eliminate the surgeon coordinating black-market extractions before the race concludes.",
